CompatibilityRemote

# User-requested design refresh for Experimental Yeet Remote (web) only.
# The native ContentView remains reserved for the user's OpenPencil design.

Shell
  LeftNavigation: 264px, collapsible; overlay below 900px
    Header: Yeet wordmark, close navigation
    NewSession: prominent full-width action
    ScrollRegion: independently scrollable, min-height 0
      Navigation: Sessions, Files, Diff, Agents; icon + label + optional count
      WorkspaceDisclosure: current workspace, expandable bounded scrollable list
      SessionSearch
      RecentSessions: title, relative age, selected and running state
    Footer: connection status, Settings; always reachable
  Main: flexible, min-width 0
    TopBar: navigation toggle, session/view title, connection, workspace-panel toggle
    Conversation: independently scrollable, centered readable column (~760px)
      Messages: generous rhythm, quiet tool disclosures, keyboard-visible actions
      EmptyState: centered greeting and workspace context
      FollowOutput: pinned only while near bottom; floating Jump to latest when reading history
    Composer: same column alignment, raised rounded surface, auto-growing field
      Controls: attachment, model, reasoning, send/stop
      Hint: keyboard behavior; not shown on touch devices
  WorkspacePanel: 320px, collapsible, visible by default at >=1280px
    Header: workspace name, close; workspace path and branch
    Tabs: Changes, Files; count for changes
    ScrollRegion: live backend-provided entries, selection and empty states
      Changes: file paths, additions/deletions, selected patch, full-page review action
      Files: directory navigation, selected file metadata, full-page browse action
    Footer: model and context usage, agents activity link
    Overlay: below 1280px; scrim, Escape dismissal, focus containment and restoration

VisualLanguage
  Warm neutral canvas; distinct navigation and raised composer; subtle borders.
  Light/dark via existing appearance setting; no new business logic or protocol.
  Consistent outline icons, 8px spacing rhythm, readable muted labels.
  Restrained panel entrances, hover/press/focus feedback; respect reduced motion.
  Touch targets >=44px; safe-area padding; no horizontal document overflow.
  Navigation and workspace drawers are mutually exclusive on narrow screens.
